commit 8cbf90a7130e2f49bf21bf8c1e22fa5a8b718f04

C03: music asked of a named browser asks which music and opens YouTube results for the answer in that browser (MUSIC1827)

The mind reads «abrí chrome y poné música», «open Edge and play some music» and «pon música de rock en chrome» as music in a named browser: without a title the existing media clarification asks which music (an early guard keeps the English form out of the open-and-play mission), the answer completes «pon música de <answer> en <browser>», and that resolves to the reviewed browser.navigate.named with the named browser and https://www.youtube.com/results for the person's words; the answer-turn binding reads the resumed objective. General mechanism: any named browser, any music.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


